<title>USA: Security Associates, EchoStar in venture.</title>
<headline>Security Associates, EchoStar in venture.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON HEIGHTS, Ill. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Associates International said on Monday it will join EchoStar Communications Corp in a venture to market EchoStar satellite dishes through Security's dealer network.</p>
<p>Security said marketing satellite dishes can give alarm dealers an opportunity to sell upgraded security systems.</p>
</text>
